Submitter: Operations supervisor of a chain store (account ending in 4471)
Content involved: Comment posted at {date} {time}, original text “This supplier’s frozen goods purchase price rose 18% this quarter, and our {site} has already switched orders,” judged as “false information,” deleted and throttled for 7 days.
