1. Checked the appeal attachment “{batch} Batch Price Comparison Table”; the header states the statistical period as 2022 Q3 to 2022 Q4, which differs by two years from “this quarter” referred to by the comment involved;
2. Retrieved the platform-retained quotation records for the same supplier in 2024 Q2 and Q3; both periods are 25.3 yuan/kg, 0% quarter-on-quarter. The comment’s claim “rose 18%” has no corresponding data in that period;
3. The appellant added a message at {date} {time}: “The table may have been the wrong one”; as of the review, no new evidence had been submitted;
4. Unrelated item: this account has another appeal, {ticket}, involving an image watermark issue, which has been routed separately.
Basis for conclusion: the counter-evidence material does not correspond to the time period involved, and there was no price increase in the current period. Confidence: Very high.

